{"summary":"A Ball Bouncer With Depth","description":"Dig deep underground by shooting balls and breaking blocks, traversing your way to the planet cores. With limited shots per round and some blocks fixed firmly to the wall, thoughtfully strategize and aim for maximum impact. Knock down as many blocks as possible while collecting crystals for upgrades and getting deeper beneath the surface.\nChoose your ideal upgrades such as more starting balls, more shots per round, or storing more crystals, based on your play style and overall strategy. Work your way into the procedurally generated planets with a delightful spectacle of bouncing as you get closer to the planet’s core.\n\nBalance your plan between ball bouncing patterns and unpredictable, surprising bounces in this mesmerizing and curious game oozing with charm. Immerse yourself in a world of extravagant minimalistic art while jamming out to an original space acid soundtrack as you feel the satisfaction of digging further underground.\n\nFeatures:\n• Six planets to dig through\n• Original soundtrack of seven diverse and space-acid themed tunes\n• A tight experience with 5+ hours of gameplay’\n• Intuitive, one-handed play\n• Endless play mode\n• 5 achievements\n• 11 leaderboards\n• Split view support\n• Toggle for screen shake","esrbNotes":null,"pegiNotes":null,"iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/a1oi3EDwbTE?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/vEeLia4l0ZfdiodPw82PChrYGQGT0HwLxnS1xglbbLSEC2iFCG37CzukdL9eUQiwEZVopoMAHg5DmypPTiSYXfA","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/_QoLw9cUJfqbMpwSYJ5vgDoN28NIk4_-8KMviK0RsDuFrztjuydgTpbFIVAvEDRxnIeDAYsPFMqQOnenpuToUg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/TOVpyzATH8uoC4_KGLHoB9Rjy_GOjVPkqMl2wFmvx5wYRjtVaXJYZ2o50d2fWHzCqO6AaTj9tyGDfWv9JDbm-SQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/YIVtDSexJ6zcdB6-hnp6SfOGmF-nZCV6EsZvwBUg1b6gUsluOjrl_Q7SIvhYj-lYih-HQn4KhzSCkxWc4zzYtg","https://play-lh.googleus